# Conformance probe pack for the CRC-32 checksum of the `tlv` wire (spec
# 0.27). Public. A local set in the shape MISB ST 0806 uses: a 16-byte key, a
# BER length, BER-OID tags, BER lengths and a crc32 checksum item of tag 1 at
# the end, with a nested set and residue.
format        conformance-tlv-crc32
version       0.27.0
distribution  public
source        "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses          probe
wire          tlv
key           060e2b34020b01010e01030102000000
checksum      crc32 1

field    time_ms      2:8      uint
field    uid          3        utf8
field    probe.n      4:2      twos
field    lat          13:4     sscale:90/2147483647
field    probe.x      48.2:1   uint
